                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "During this Save Our Hospitals Week of Action, I visited @umbwmc to see operations firsthand and have a frank discussion about potential funding cuts coming from Washington. UMBWMC and their first responder partners are doing some incredibly innovative things to reduce emergency department wait times, focus on long-term patient health, and save lives. Hospitals across Maryland and the nation already operate on razor-thin budgets, and the nearly $1 trillion cut to health care proposed in the President\u2019s Big Beautiful Bill would put their life-saving programs and services at direct risk. It\u2019s why I voted no last month \u2013 and will vote no again when the Senate sends the bill back to the House.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": [
                    "umbwmc"
                ],
                "text_tagged_users_ids": [
                    "22314062"
