                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Every day, @MDCancerCare gives patients hope through integrated, evidence-based cancer care and clinical research. Their physicians, doctors, and directors break down barriers to care and ease the stress of patients and families when navigating some of their hardest days. From expanding community opportunities to federal policy,  I will keep fighting to ensure our doctors have the resources they need to provide care, and that every Marylander has access to the high-quality care they deserve.",
