                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Calling all Maryland Employers! Maryland\u2019s Service Year Option program gives young Marylanders a unique opportunity to serve their communities \u2013 through schools, hospitals, local businesses, nonprofits, and even government agencies \u2013 all while gaining valuable skills, professional development opportunities, and a chance to explore career pathways.\u00a0\n\nThere\u2019s been an overwhelming response from our young Marylanders to enroll in this program, which is why we need YOUR help. If you\u2019re an employer, consider serving as a Host Site Partner. By hosting one of the members, you\u2019re not only meeting immediate talent needs \u2013 you\u2019re investing in a thriving and stronger Maryland. Learn more at the link below:\n\nhttps://t.co/fYpnGrtMO3",
