                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "More than 190,000 Marylanders rely on lower premiums from enhanced tax credits to access affordable health care \u2013 but these credits will expire at the end of 2025 because of President Trump\u2019s Big Ugly Law. I\u2019m grateful I could stop by our team\u2019s meeting with the Maryland Health Benefit Exchange to discuss how we can work together to ensure all Marylanders have the life-saving care they need.",
