                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Instead of ensuring that millions of Americans\u2019 health insurance premiums don\u2019t skyrocket and millions lose their health insurance, the President would rather shut the government down, put our national security at risk, and play with the livelihoods of our hardworking civil servants who administer critical services and programs nationwide. These federal employees work day in and day out to deliver essential services to the American people, regardless of party \u2013 they are not pawns in the President's political games.\n\nhttps://t.co/puuRQVmL1C",
