                "text": "Today is the first day of open enrollment for Medicare. If you are 65+, you can enroll or make changes to your Medicare Advantage plan, medication plan, or general coverage from now until December 7th, 2025. Additionally, if you ever need help with Medicare or any other program, please don\u2019t hesitate to reach out to our office at (410) 832-8890.\n\nhttps://t.co/UhvvAvNOvQ",
