                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "As our constituents receive notices of their health care premiums increasing, Congress must act to reopen the government, extend the ACA tax credits, and protect the health care of millions of Americans. Today at Chase Brexton\u2019s Glen Burnie Center, @MDComptroller, Senator Pam Beidle, Delegate Dana Jones, and I discussed the importance of these ACA tax credits to not only the over 190,000 Marylanders who rely on them, but to our health care system as a whole. Thank you @chasebrexton for hosting us for your work each and every day caring for our community.",
