                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Over the past four weeks, I\u2019ve heard from many of you who have been impacted by the shutdown \u2013 and time and time again, I\u2019m hearing from constituents and their family members whose premiums are set to skyrocket if Congress does not extend the ACA tax credits. Open enrollment begins November 1st, and insurance companies have already sent out notices about higher premiums \u2013 it\u2019s time for Speaker Johnson to call us back to Washington to negotiate a bipartisan budget deal that re-opens the government and addresses this health care crisis.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
