                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Is my Medicaid going to change? With President Trump\u2019s Big Ugly Law, many Marylanders are finding themselves asking this question. For most of the 1.5 million Marylanders who rely on Medicaid for coverage, their care will not be impacted \u2013 however nearly 300,000 Marylanders will see changes in their Medicaid starting January 2027. For more details on whether new Medicaid rules may apply to you, check out the link below:\n\nhttps://t.co/cDLuivgEwT",
