                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "With only a few legislative days left this year, there is still a lot of work left to do to stop your health care premiums from skyrocketing on January 1st. That\u2019s why I\u2019ll be sitting down with House Democratic Caucus Chair, @RepPeteAguilar, to discuss what House Democrats are doing to tackle the ongoing health care crisis as we enter the new year. We\u2019ll be going live and taking YOUR questions on Monday, December 15th at 7:30 PM ET @RepSarahElfreth on Instagram!",
